      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test. The original has several issues: unused imports, an unused `data_invalid()` method, and a monolithic test method that bundles six unrelated assertions together. I'll clean those up and split assertions into focused, named tests.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports and the dead `data_invalid()` method, then splits the single monolithic test into six focused, `@DisplayName`-annotated test methods — one per assertion — so each failure is immediately identifiable by name."
